      "w": 420,
      "text": "PAYO revamp — for your approval\n\nRow 1: Login, Home, Assistant, Activity, Receipt\nRow 2: Pay hub, Send (recipient → amount → confirm → PIN → success)\nRow 3: Bills, Savings, Card, Statements, More\nRow 4: Dark mode, Urdu (RTL), Home Option B\n\nEnglish-first. Assistant understands English, Urdu and code-mixed input; replies follow the app language.\nAI bar is docked above the tabs on every tab screen — one tap to speak or type from anywhere.\nMoney safety gate unchanged: confirm → PIN → execute."
    },
    {
      "id": "note-options",
      "x": 1920,
      "y": 2952,
      "w": 380,
      "text": "Home: two directions\n\nOption A (recommended): cream background, white balance card — calm, bank-like, best readability for older users.\n\nOption B: navy hero header with the balance on dark — bolder brand presence, closer to Stable's dark bars, slightly lower contrast for body text below.\n\nPick one; everything else stays the same."
    }
